  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Inside the true inheritance secluded domain of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, Fang Yuan summons a palm-sized Gu with no solid body. It looks like a butterfly and flickers like light and shadow; a grab finds only a hollow form. It is the rank two big soul worm.",
        "chapters": [
          598
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Wills can only reside within the soul. To send a special will out, Fang Yuan places that will into the big soul worm and sends the worm ahead of him. Its flight is much faster than Fang Yuan moving alone. It enters a green-white true inheritance light lump and returns with a tattered body, after which he retrieves the will and reads what it learned.",
        "chapters": [
          598
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "carrying-will",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He uses the same pairing of special will Gu and big soul worm on later true inheritances in the secluded domain, including the empty third inheritance that once held possession Immortal Gu and the sixth lifespan inheritance.",
        "chapters": [
          599
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "carrying-will",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_special_will_gu",
          "gu_possession_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When he sends the worm toward a burning white unparalleled true inheritance, the link weakens and breaks before the worm reaches three hundred steps. The worm hangs still with no injury, but the special will inside it is gone, so he cannot command it until he approaches and examines it by hand.",
        "chapters": [
          600
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "will-link-severed",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
